    assess: "Weekly check: ask learners why Scripture forbids the occult and what the Ephesians did.",
    mcq1: ["What did the Ephesian believers do in Acts 19:19?", ["Burned their books of magic", "Sold them", "Hid them", "Studied them"], 0, "They burned their books."],
    mcq2: ["What does Colossians 2:9-10 say about Christ?", ["In him the whole fullness of deity dwells bodily, and we are filled in him", "He is one among many powers", "He is far away", "He is only a teacher"], 0, "Christ is sufficient."],
